text:
Iranian Foreign Minister Abbas Araghchi said that Supreme Leader Ayatollah Ali Khamenei and President Masoud Pezeshkian are alive, “as far as I know.”

He added that all high-ranking officials are alive and that “everything is fine,” pushing back against reports suggesting major leadership casualties.

@nbcnews

Magen David Adom said three people were injured in Hezbollah rocket attacks on northern Israel, including two in serious condition.

A 25-year-old motorcyclist and a 17-year-old girl were seriously wounded by shrapnel near Karmiel, while a man in his 40s was moderately injured in Nahariya.

@mdaisrael.en
